569 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 227 0 R
/T (Signova demonstrates a basic real-time sign-language recognition system using computer vision and web technologies. The system extracts hand landmarks using MediaPipe, recognizes selected gestures using a landmark-based recognition model, and integrates Flask, React and MySQL. The current prototype provides a foundation that can be extended with a larger vocabulary, improved recognition models and continuous sign-language translation.)
/E (Signova demonstrates a basic real-time sign-language recognition system using computer vision and web technologies. The system extracts hand landmarks using MediaPipe, recognizes selected gestures using a landmark-based recognition model, and integrates Flask, React and MySQL. The current prototype provides a foundation that can be extended with a larger vocabulary, improved recognition models and continuous sign-language translation.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
