/Title (Signova demonstrates a basic real-time sign-language recognition system using computer vision and web technologies. The system extracts hand landmarks using MediaPipe, recognizes selected gestures using a landmark-based recognition model, and integrates Flask, React and MySQL. The current prototype provides a foundation that can be extended with a larger vocabulary, improved recognition models and continuous sign-language translation.)
